# /sitemap.xml is the address tools and crawlers try first. Astro's sitemap
# integration writes sitemap-index.xml instead, and robots.txt already names
# that one — this line is only for whoever guesses.
#
# Host-level redirects (www, pages.dev) cannot live here: this file matches
# paths. Those are in functions/_middleware.js.
/sitemap.xml /sitemap-index.xml 301
